  "description": "The JustGage extension component uses the cool JustGage (http://justgage.com/) widget to render animated, nice and clean gauges. It is based on Raphaël library for vector drawing, so it’s completely resolution independent and self-adjusting. As a Wisej.NET Real Time widget you can set several properties: value, label, colors, range and more.",
